{{!
    @template format_aicourse/general_section

    The General section (section 0) rendered inline above the AI Course card grid.

    Two shapes are possible. When a teacher is editing, or when the format is not in card mode, the
    whole section is handed to core's own section output class and the result is dropped in
    verbatim, so teachers keep every edit control and students see exactly what core would show.
    Otherwise the section is drawn as a heading, an optional summary and the activity card grid.

    The heading is a real <h2> so the <h3> card titles below sit at the correct depth under the
    page <h1>; when the teacher has not renamed the section it is hidden visually with the core
    .accesshide class rather than dropped, so the heading outline stays intact.

    Classes required for JS:
    * None.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * None.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasoutput bool False when there is genuinely nothing to show; the template then emits nothing.
    * usecoresection bool True when corecontent should be used instead of the card rendering.
    * corecontent string PRE-ESCAPED HTML rendered by core's section output class. Rendered with a
      triple mustache because it is already rendered, escaped markup.
    * headingclass string CSS classes of the section heading.
    * sectionname string PRE-ESCAPED section name (already through format_string()); rendered with
      a triple mustache so the entities format_string() produced are not escaped twice.
    * hassummary bool True when the section has a summary to show.
    * summary string PRE-ESCAPED summary HTML (already through format_text() with the course
      context, so it is cleaned and filtered); rendered with a triple mustache.
    * activitycards object|null Context for format_aicourse/activity_cards, or null when the
      section has no content modules.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasoutput": true,
        "usecoresection": false,
        "corecontent": "",
        "headingclass": "aicourse-general-heading accesshide",
        "sectionname": "General",
        "hassummary": true,
        "summary": "<p>Welcome to the course.</p>",
        "activitycards": {
            "regionlabel": "General",
            "showheading": false,
            "sectionname": "General",
            "cards": [],
            "hascontentrows": false,
            "contentrows": [],
            "isempty": false,
            "sectionid": 34,
            "notfound": false
        }
    }
}}
{{#hasoutput}}
<div class="aicourse-general-section">
{{#usecoresection}}{{{corecontent}}}{{/usecoresection}}
{{^usecoresection}}
<h2 class="{{headingclass}}">{{{sectionname}}}</h2>
{{#hassummary}}
<div class="aicourse-general-summary">{{{summary}}}</div>
{{/hassummary}}
{{#activitycards}}
{{> format_aicourse/activity_cards }}
{{/activitycards}}
{{/usecoresection}}
</div>
{{/hasoutput}}
